title: 'cumulus: wire resubmission of segments per core'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |
    The slot-based collator now resubmits its resubmittable segment. For each core it hydrates the
    resubmittable headers from local state (off the block-production hot path) and submits them,
    oldest first, ahead of the freshly-built bundle.
crates:
- name: cumulus-client-consensus-aura
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: patch
